<https://example.com/atelier/uk/fastener/FS%205> atelier:matesWith frf:RF-5 .
frc:HY-5 atelier:matesWith <https://example.com/atelier/uk/coupling/HYD%205> .
<https://example.com/atelier/uk/coupling/HYD%205> atelier:matesWith frc:HY-5 .
frp:J61 atelier:matesWith <https://example.com/atelier/uk/plug/HC%2061> .
<https://example.com/atelier/uk/plug/HC%2061> atelier:matesWith frp:J61 .
frc:HY-6 atelier:matesWith <https://example.com/atelier/uk/coupling/HYD%206> .
<https://example.com/atelier/uk/coupling/HYD%206> atelier:matesWith frc:HY-6 .
esp:J72 atelier:matesWith dep:P72 . dep:P72 atelier:matesWith esp:J72 .
esp:J82 atelier:matesWith esp:P82 . esp:P82 atelier:matesWith esp:J82 .

